  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Beatrix**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Don’s Place**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Track Four**: back after 139 archived shows (5084 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **East Side**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Cabriolet**: rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Track Seven**: back after 401 archived shows (9129 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **In the Memory of Elizabeth Reed**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2024-06-09** (recommended): source not stated; 9 songs; 73 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper positioned at DFC, in the last seat against the back wall [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2024-06-09**: taped by Mark Davidson; transferred by Mark Davidson; source: AKG CK61 ULS (DIN) > Nbob Actives > Baby Nbox > F3 @ 32 bit/96kHz [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG CK61 ULS capsules through DIN connection, then Nbob Actives, Baby Nbox, and an F3 recorder at 32-bit/96kHz; Transfer path: micro SD card to WAV, edited in Adobe Audition, converted to FLAC at 24-bit/48kHz using xACT [1]",
